---
import { url } from '../utils/url';
---
<section class="paths-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-heading">Three ways in.</h2>
    <div class="paths-grid">
      <!-- Path 1: Learn -->
      <div class="path-card">
        <div class="path-marker">01 / Developer</div>
        <h3 class="path-title">Build with it</h3>
        <p class="path-body">Get from npm install to a working client or server in minutes. The README walks through it; the API reference covers everything. Browse the broader ecosystem on the <a href={url("projects.html")}>Projects page</a>.</p>
        <a href="/api_doc/latest/" class="path-cta">Read the docs <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>

      <!-- Path 2: Use -->
      <div class="path-card">
        <div class="path-marker">02 / Industrial buyer</div>
        <h3 class="path-title">Use it in production</h3>
        <p class="path-body">For SLA-backed support, certified builds, consulting, and the commercial module ecosystem maintained by Sterfive, see the company that builds and maintains node-opcua.</p>
        <a href={url("commercial-use.html")} class="path-cta">Commercial support <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>

      <!-- Path 3: Sustain -->
      <div class="path-card">
        <div class="path-marker">03 / Sponsor</div>
        <h3 class="path-title">Sustain the project</h3>
        <p class="path-body">node-opcua is maintained primarily by one engineer at Sterfive. Sponsorship from companies that depend on the stack keeps the open project healthy and roadmap-driven. Founding Sponsor positions remain open through 2026.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/node-opcua" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="path-cta">Become a sponsor <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .paths-section {
    padding: var(--space-section) 0;
    background-color: var(--bg);
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-stack-xl);
  }
  .paths-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-stack-xl);
  }
  .path-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding-top: var(--space-stack-md);
    background-color: transparent;
    border-radius: 0;
    position: relative;
  }
  .path-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -2px;
    left: 0;
    width: 32px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .path-marker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
  .path-title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-stack-sm);
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .path-body {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }
  .path-body a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .path-body a:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .path-cta {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .path-cta:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .arrow {
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .path-cta:hover .arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }
  
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .paths-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-stack-xl);
    }
  }
</style>
